>
    <figure class="not-prose my-6">
    <img src="/images/outage-dark-vs-powered.webp" alt="Street during an outage: dark home beside a powered home with backup" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#e5e7eb]" />
